{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_8000_situation", "source_sha256": "f9587769ca7c5381105e2529737af108ee8390e9c4cf2c28d9588783ba22a012", "ja": "グラビア撮影のお仕事　開始前", "zh": "写真拍摄工作　开始前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_8000_place", "source_sha256": "df7a65bb1371b4419398c0760cd46a47118e1b0668837a4271b37c9eca0cfaff", "ja": "教室", "zh": "教室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_8001_p", "source_sha256": "601cdd0d5882121301b6459f04409c2ea88abcb090bab4e463952cf3f70724d2", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア企画で、\n百合子は『クラスで人気のギャル』を演じる）", "zh": "（在偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真企划中，百合子将饰演“班里人气很高的辣妹”）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_8002_026yur", "source_sha256": "db8cf9b1b1413d27d34e3b075f646e0c94bf309cf7a9242666851af0230b2f19", "ja": "ギャル……。ギャル……？　あの、明るくてオシャレな\n人たちに、私が本当になれるんでしょうか……。", "zh": "辣妹……辣妹？那个……我真的能成为那种开朗又时髦的人吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_8003_p", "source_sha256": "8ec576db76d3443a37b37b81353da24b211b4c8ee6022689e1ba645bcd5b02ff", "ja": "制服も似合ってるし、大丈夫だと思うけど。\n何か気になることでもあるのか？", "zh": "制服也很适合你，我觉得没问题。\n是有什么在意的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_8004_026yur", "source_sha256": "37ea7cc81ac3f57446230a4c00d6b82d1032e530af77223ef60d15cd492ed21b", "ja": "はい……。どう考えても、私がイメージするギャルと\n今の私に、とんでもない差がある気がして……。", "zh": "是的……不管怎么想，我所想象的辣妹形象，和现在的我之间似乎都有着天大的差距……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_8005_026yur", "source_sha256": "b3ee5d3bcb34e4df5c33c702ab8bb82739c62c6291c38190e7978e012424169b", "ja": "学校にいるギャルのみなさんを観察したんですけど。\nこう、キラキラとした光のオーラがあるんです！", "zh": "我观察了一下学校里的辣妹们。\n感觉她们身上都带着一种……闪闪发光的光之气场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_8006_026yur", "source_sha256": "a99a5453bdefa9d7cec7b5d94bcb78a11d65794bc02a2158b2b9076c2be803f6", "ja": "……私がギャルのみなさんに近づくには、\nどういうところを意識すればいいでしょうか？", "zh": "……要想让我更贴近辣妹们的话，\n应该注意哪些方面才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_8007", "source_sha256": "9e434f1744486e6c33c25d790ab408a2aaabc536db2f32b001189db20c61432b", "ja": "人柄", "zh": "为人性格", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_8008", "source_sha256": "9f3b556b6425945fb374fa20b466d4f1f3afc3f3bec9e24d56b3eb0cd2c0229c", "ja": "距離感", "zh": "距离感", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_8009", "source_sha256": "37af1c34819b1c28aae36849248f84c7f0f0122091a7df099e6c27303def79ec", "ja": "勢い！", "zh": "气势！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_8100_p", "source_sha256": "c4177b62b663bdc1a224e572781e6afb5aa094960334136c79b63338657d9dd6", "ja": "ギャルは元気で前向きな印象だけど……\n百合子が観察した感想を、もう少し聞かせてくれるか？", "zh": "辣妹给人的印象是活泼又积极，不过……\n能不能再多说一点百合子观察后的感想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_8101_026yur", "source_sha256": "624a75581cc9b47fad5155b8eee0498fff973ac6586b9761519afe1f642c4f6b", "ja": "えっと、明るくて話が上手で、でも私みたいな子にも、\n優しく笑顔で気さくに話しかけてくれて……。", "zh": "那个，性格开朗又很会聊天，而且还会对我这种人温柔地笑着，亲切地搭话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_8102_026yur", "source_sha256": "1800fb33d0ca792d511afdb5a5711aae10dea859ec596c693a22813658bd3d99", "ja": "とっても自由……ハッ！　そういうことですね……！\nギャルのキラキラ、つかめた気がします！", "zh": "非常自由……啊！原来是这样……！\n我好像抓住辣妹的闪耀之处了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_8200_p", "source_sha256": "116d6ec6c6b87fd353751c2a524303f095cfb486cffb1dfd96f88ebbf81717fa", "ja": "イメージだけど、ギャルの子はイタズラっぽかったり、\n距離感の掴み方が上手いような気がするな。", "zh": "虽然只是印象，但我觉得辣妹可能有点爱恶作剧，而且似乎很擅长把握与人相处的距离感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_8201_026yur", "source_sha256": "190b29232ed9cfeee253c3831c768b4ac4eade431f1b76667399814017d9948f", "ja": "なるほど！　たしかにそうかもしれません。\n話していると、いつの間にか仲良くなってるかも……。", "zh": "原来如此！确实有可能呢。\n聊着聊着，说不定不知不觉就变得要好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_8202_026yur", "source_sha256": "d21a334f4274ff9f65e0acf52336b38c5de5bf69197a19971610cd2ded6699e1", "ja": "私がそれをするって考えると……い、いえ！\nここはポジティブな妄想で、乗り越えてみせます！", "zh": "要是想到要由我来做这件事……不、不对！\n这里就用积极的幻想，来克服它吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_8300_p", "source_sha256": "6f31cd5242d1783a6e48e3a502b035742d094018f127ff5406e1087962ba637a", "ja": "ギャルの極意とはなんだと思う？　それは深く\n考えないことだ！　ここは勢いに任せていこう！", "zh": "你觉得辣妹的精髓是什么？那就是不要想太多！现在就顺势上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_8301_026yur", "source_sha256": "2926081aa161b8b7c01a8fa04722ec2a8cd43b9b2165b50733c94954a97e59e4", "ja": "ええっ！？　で、でも、ノリが大事って言います\nもんね。やっぱり、一番大切なのは、勢い……？", "zh": "诶！？可、可是，大家不是都说气氛很重要吗？果然最重要的还是气势……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_8302_026yur", "source_sha256": "3d0d93ad78936a62bdb5504b6d9fff7d021817225beffd84497598431538421d", "ja": "「ね、この後さぁ～、ふたりで遊び行かない？」とか？\nあうう……私にはそういうの、やっぱり無理です～！！", "zh": "“呐，等会儿啊～要不要两个人一起去玩？”之类的？\n呜呜……那种方式对我来说果然还是太勉强了～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
